=20

I am trying out the a2play in head version btsco package, basically it
works great except that seems it's very sensitive to system event, if I
leave the my notebook there playing without doing anything, I can listen
hours music without any problem, however, if I try to something on the
same pc, like edit some file or browse the internet, audio will be
stopped,  message like

            Read 3321c0 1080 times / sec=20

Will stop moving, as I can tell, Bluetooth links seem ok, I tried below
command, slightly better, but still happen, any idea what might be goes
wrong with my settings ? thanks in advance.

=20

            Mpg123 -au - *.mp3 -aggressive | ./a2play xx:xx:xx:xx:xx:xx

=20

BTW, I still have trouble with plugins from plugz package, sco works
fine all the time.

=20

Regards/Quinton


